u berhenti, list = lihat daftar akun, stats = statistik.\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"env_variable\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"STARTUP_CMD\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"default_value\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"./startup.sh auto\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"user_viewable\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"user_editable\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"rules\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"required|string|max:50\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"field_type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Token Bot Telegram\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Opsional. Token dari @BotFather untuk notifikasi perubahan status akun.\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"env_variable\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"TG_BOT_TOKEN\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"default_value\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"user_viewable\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"user_editable\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"rules\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"nullable|string|max:64\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"field_type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\"\\\\n    },\\\\n    {\\\\n      \\\\\\\"name\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Chat ID Telegram\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"description\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"Opsional. Chat ID tujuan notifikasi (bisa ambil dari @userinfobot).\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"env_variable\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"TG_CHAT_ID\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"default_value\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"user_viewable\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"user_editable\\\\\\\": true,\\\\n      \\\\\\\"rules\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"nullable|string|max:32\\\\\\\",\\\\n      \\\\\\\"field_type\\\\\\\": \\\\\\\"text\\\\\\\"\\\\n    }\\\\n  ]\\\\n}\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/runner/ptero-akun-parent-manager/eggs/egg-akun-parent-manager.json\\\"}\"}}, {\"id\": \"call_a039270ebccb451cb587ad17\", \"call_id\": \"call_a039270ebccb451cb587ad17\", \"response_item_id\": \"fc_a039270ebccb451cb587ad17\", \"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"write_file\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"email,password,recovery,proxy,imap_host,imap_port,note\\\\ncontoh.parent1@gmail.com,GANTI-PASSWORD-APP,recovery1@outlook.com,,imap.gmail.com,993,contoh format\\\\ncontoh.parent2@gmail.com,GANTI-PASSWORD-APP,recovery2@proton.me,,,,\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/runner/ptero-akun-parent-manager/parents.example.csv\\\"}\"}}, {\"id\": \"call_c9d556af8e8e47c8813f3b8a\", \"call_id\": \"call_c9d556af8e8e47c8813f3b8a\", \"response_item_id\": \"fc_c9d556af8e8e47c8813f3b8a\", \"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"write_file\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"# 🎯 Ptero Akun Parent Manager (Bot Python)\\\\n\\\\nBot untuk panel **Pterodactyl** yang mengelola & memantau **akun parent (induk)**:\\\\n\\\\n- 🔍 **Cek kesehatan** via IMAP login (Gmail & provider lain) — akun yang login gagal = kandidat kenon/block\\\\n- 🔄 **Auto-monitor 24/7** di Pterodactyl — cek berkala sesuai interval, akun bermasalah langsung kelihatan\\\\n- 📤 **Export akun yang masih sehat** ke CSV/JSON (tinggal pakai buat clustering recovery / jualan)\\\\n- 📨 **Notifikasi Telegram** saat status akun berubah (sehat → bermasalah, atau sebaliknya)\\\\n- 🌐 **Dukungan proxy SOCKS5** per akun\\\\n- 📥 **Import massal** dari CSV\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 📁 Struktur\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\nptero-akun-parent-manager/\\\\n├── main.py              ← entry point (CLI)\\\\n├── config.json          ← pengaturan interval, IMAP, telegram\\\\n├── accounts.json        ← database akun (DIBUAT OTOMATIS, berisi password!)\\\\n├── parents.example.csv  ← contoh format import\\\\n├── requirements.txt     ← requests, PySocks\\\\n├── startup.sh           ← startup script untuk Pterodactyl\\\\n├── eggs/\\\\n│   └── egg-akun-parent-manager.json   ← egg siap-import\\\\n├── manager/\\\\n│   ├── database.py      ← simpan/ambil akun (JSON thread-safe)\\\\n│   ├── health.py        ← pemeriksa IMAP + proxy SOCKS5\\\\n│   ├── notifier.py      ← notifikasi Telegram\\\\n│   ├── exporter.py      ← export CSV/JSON\\\\n│   └── utils.py\\\\n└── logs/app.log         ← log (dibuat otomatis)\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## ⚡ Perintah\\\\n\\\\n```bash\\\\npython3 main.py add --email parent1@gmail.com --password APP-PASSWORD \\\\\\\\\\\\n                    --recovery recovery1@outlook.com --check\\\\n\\\\npython3 main.py list                      # semua akun\\\\npython3 main.py list --status healthy     # hanya yang sehat\\\\n\\\\npython3 main.py check                     # cek semua sekarang (manual)\\\\npython3 main.py auto --interval 60        # monitor terus-menerus tiap 60 menit\\\\n\\\\npython3 main.py export                    # export yang SEHAT (csv + json)\\\\npython3 main.py export --status unhealthy --format csv --out kenon.csv\\\\n\\\\npython3 main.py import --file parents.csv # import massal\\\\npython3 main.py set --email x@gmail.com --paused true\\\\npython3 main.py remove --email x@gmail.com --yes\\\\npython3 main.py stats\\\\npython3 main.py tg-test                   # tes notifikasi telegram\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\nFormat CSV import/export:\\\\n\\\\n```\\\\nemail,password,recovery,proxy,imap_host,imap_port,note\\\\ncontoh.parent1@gmail.com,xxxx,recovery1@outlook.com,,imap.gmail.com,993,catatan\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 🖥️ Deploy ke Pterodactyl (2 cara)\\\\n\\\\n### Cara A — Pakai egg yang disediakan (recommended)\\\\n\\\\n1. **Admin panel** → **Nests** → **Import Egg** → pilih `eggs/egg-akun-parent-manager.json`\\\\n2. Buat server baru pakai nest/egg tersebut (image **Python 3.11**)\\\\n3. Upload isi zip ini via **File Manager** (extract di folder root server)\\\\n4. Set variabel (opsional): `TG_BOT_TOKEN` & `TG_CHAT_ID` untuk notifikasi Telegram\\\\n5. **Start server** → installer otomatis buat venv + install requirements\\\\n6. Tambah akun via console: `./startup.sh add --email ... --password ... --check`\\\\n   (atau klik **Reinstall** dulu supaya installer jalan, lalu pakai console)\\\\n\\\\n### Cara B — Egg Python standar\\\\n\\\\n1. Buat server pakai egg **Python** bawaan panel\\\\n2. Upload isi zip, extract di root\\\\n3. Startup command: `./startup.sh auto`\\\\n   (`startup.sh` otomatis install requirements kalau belum ada)\\\\n\\\\n> ⚠️ Saat server pertama start, tunggu sampai console muncul *\\\\\\\"Monitoring AKUN PARENT dimulai\\\\\\\"*.\\\\n> Log lengkap tersimpan di `logs/app.log` (bisa dilihat lewat tab **Logs** di panel).\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 📨 Notifikasi Telegram (opsional)\\\\n\\\\n1. Chat **@BotFather** → `/newbot` → dapat token\\\\n2. Chat **@userinfobot** → dapat chat ID kamu\\\\n3. Isi di `config.json` (bagian `telegram`) **atau** set variabel egg `TG_BOT_TOKEN` / `TG_CHAT_ID`\\\\n4. Tes: `python3 main.py tg-test`\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## ⚠️ Catatan Penting\\\\n\\\\n- **Gmail wajib App Password** (2FA aktif): https://myaccount.google.com/apppasswords — password biasa tidak bisa buat IMAP.\\\\n- **Jangan cek terlalu sering!** Google punya rate-limit IMAP. Default interval **60 menit** & concurrency **3** — untuk ratusan akun, naikkan interval ke **240+ menit** dan concurrency maks **3-5** biar tidak kena flag.\\\\n- **`accounts.json` & file export berisi password** — setting `chmod 600`, jangan pernah share.\\\\n- **Proxy** opsional per akun, format: `socks5://user:pass@host:port`. Aktifkan pemakaiannya dengan `\\\\\\\"use_proxy\\\\\\\": true` di `config.json`.\\\\n- **Akun \\\\\\\"login ditolak\\\\\\\"** bisa berarti: app password salah, 2FA mati, akun kena verifikasi, atau kenon/block. Cek detail di kolom `last_result` (lihat `accounts.json`).\\\\n- Butuh **Python >= 3.9** (fitur `_create_socket` di imaplib). Egg yang disediakan pakai 3.11.\\\\n\\\\n---\\\\n\\\\n## 🔧 Troubleshooting\\\\n\\\\n| Gejala | Solusi |\\\\n|--------|--------|\\\\n| Semua akun \\\\\\\"login ditolak\\\\\\\" | Cek app password & 2FA; tes manual via `python3 main.py tg-test`? tidak — tes 1 akun saja dulu |\\\\n| \\\\\\\"timeout\\\\\\\" semua | Network panel / proxy mati; coba `use_proxy: false` |\\\\n| Export kosong padahal akun ada | Status belum `healthy` — jalankan `python3 main.py check` dulu |\\\\n| Tidak dapat notif Telegram | `./startup.sh tg-test`, pastikan token/chat id benar |\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/runner/ptero-akun-parent-manager/README.md\\\"}\"}}, {\"id\": \"call_79c2acb51e534d59aefb760f\", \"call_id\": \"call_79c2acb51e534d59aefb760f\", \"response_item_id\": \"fc_79c2acb51e534d59aefb760f\", \"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"write_file\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"content\\\": \\\"# File berisi password — jangan pernah commit/share\\\\naccounts.json\\\\nakun_*.csv\\\\nakun_*.json\\\\nlogs/\\\\n__pycache__/\\\\n*.pyc\\\\nvenv/\\\", \\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/runner/ptero-akun-parent-manager/.gitignore\\\"}\"}}]}], \"messages\": [{\"id\": 1496, \"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"\", \"timestamp\": 1787099602.5990183, \"tool_calls\": [{\"id\": \"call-07ab5b7c-1f05-4516-8f2c-c11308606b59\", \"call_id\": \"call-07ab5b7c-1f05-4516-8f2c-c11308606b59\", \"response_item_id\": \"fc_call-07ab5b7c-1f05-4516-8f2c-c11308606b59\", \"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"terminal\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"cd /home/runner/ptero-akun-parent-manager && python3 main.py list\\\"}\"}}]}, {\"id\": 1498, \"role\": \"assistant\", \"content\": \"\", \"timestamp\": 1787099665.8302908, \"tool_calls\": [{\"id\": \"call-24373857-18fa-4da4-8ee0-892e19b1a517\", \"call_id\": \"call-24373857-18fa-4da4-8ee0-892e19b1a517\", \"response_item_id\": \"fc_call-24373857-18fa-4da4-8ee0-892e19b1a517\", \"type\": \"function\", \"function\": {\"name\": \"terminal\", \"arguments\": \"{\\\"command\\\":\\\"cd /home/runner && zip -r ptero-akun-parent-manager.zip ptero-akun-parent-manager -x \\\\\\\"*/__pycache__/*\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"*/*.pyc\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"*/.git*\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"*/venv/*\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"*/logs/*\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"*/accounts.json\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"*/akun_*.csv\\\\\\\" \\\\\\\"*/akun_*.json\\\\\\\"\\\"}\"}}]}, {\"id\": 1500, \"role\": \"user\", \"content\": \"[CONTEXT COMPACTION — REFERENCE ONLY] Earlier turns were compacted into the s